| + getVida() : int                 |
| + getAtaque() : int               |
| + calcularDano() : int            |
| + toString() : String             |
+----------------------------------+
       ▲             ▲             ▲             ▲
       |             |             |             |
+------------+ +------------+ +------------+ +------------+
|    Mago    | |  Guerrero  | |  Villano   | |  Aldeano   |
+------------+ +------------+ +------------+ +------------+
| - mana     | | - armadura | | - amenaza  | | - oro      |
+------------+ +------------+ +------------+ +------------+
| calcularDano sobrescrito en Mago, Villano y Aldeano; Guerrero lo hereda |
+-------------------------------------------------------------------------+
                              ▲
                              | ArrayList<Personaje>
+----------------------------------+
|               Main               |
+----------------------------------+
| + main(String[]) : void          |
| - mostrarMenu() : void            |
| - leerOpcion() : int              |
| - leerEntero(String) : int         |
| - leerTexto(String) : String       |
